cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "ProjetAN: numerical simulation of a trophic cascade with five coupled ODEs"
abstract: >-
  Numerical analysis project at Polytech Nice Sophia (MAM3): a model of a
  trophic cascade (vegetation, elk, deer, wolves, bears) as five coupled
  nonlinear ODEs, solved with explicit Euler, implicit Euler, Crank-Nicolson
  and RK4 in Python. Includes a Yellowstone scenario where wolves are
  reintroduced after 20 years and a convergence study of the four methods.
